      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Kernkonzepte:\n\n• Dual-Engine Ansatz:\n  - RCC für UI/Web Automation\n  - UV für API/Data Processing\n\n• ProcessCube Integration:\n  - BPMN External Tasks\n  - Work Items für I/O\n  - Topic-basiertes Routing\n\n• Hot Reload:\n  - File System Watcher\n  - Auto-Packing\n  - Dynamic Registration\n\n• Factory Pattern:\n  - Flexible Robot Discovery\n  - Topic-zu-Agent Mapping\n  - ZIP-basierte Deployment",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kernkonzepte:\n\n• Dual-Engine Ansatz:\n  - RCC für UI/Web Automation\n  - UV für API/Data Processing\n\n• ProcessCube Integration:\n  - BPMN External Tasks\n  - Work Items für I/O\n  - Topic-basiertes Routing\n\n• Hot Reload:\n  - File System Watcher\n  - Auto-Packing\n  - Dynamic Registration\n\n• Factory Pattern:\n  - Flexible Robot Discovery\n  - Topic-zu-Agent Mapping\n  - ZIP-basierte Deployment",
